  "title": "Wo? Im Zimmer",
  "subtitle": "Two-way prepositions with the dative",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "in, an, auf, vor, hinter, über, unter, neben and zwischen take the dative when you answer Wo? The person or thing stays there.",
        "Masculine and neuter dative is dem: im Zimmer means in dem Zimmer, auf dem Tisch, neben dem Bett.",
        "Feminine dative is der: in der Tasche. Plural dative is den: auf den Betten.",
        "ins Zimmer answers Wohin? That direction is the next chapter. Here nothing moves into a new place."
      ],
