      "heroTitle": "Nine prepositions, dative for a place",
      "heroImage": "bed",
      "story": [
        "Ask <b>Wo?</b> and use the dative. The chart is already on the table. It does not move.",
        "in + dem = <b>im</b>. an + dem = <b>am</b>. Feminine stays der: in <b>der</b> Tasche. Plural is den: auf <b>den</b> Betten.",
        "<b>ins</b> Zimmer and <b>auf den</b> Tisch answer Wohin? Save those for the next chapter."
      ],
      "questionRule": "Wo? means the dative: dem, der or den. im and am are the contractions.",
